    "detailed_description": "JACKPOISON fully permits both corporate and individual users to make videos and live-stream games.<br><br>This game is a combination of <strong>slot</strong> and <strong>battle RPG</strong>!<br>You eat mushrooms and control <strong>slots</strong>,<br>You can accumulate coins to unlock skills!<br>Rescue the fairies from the bosses who abuse the power of mushrooms!<br><br><u><strong>Four main elements of the game</strong></u>.<br><br><strong>Slots</strong>.<br>\u3000From the <strong>slot</strong>, there are roles that simply increase the coins or allow you to progress in <strong>combat</strong>, such as attacking.<br>\u3000Matching 7s will give you a large amount of coins and progress the game significantly.<br><br>The <strong>skill tree</strong>.<br>\u3000Spend the coins increased by <strong>slots</strong> to open up skills.<br>\u3000There are nearly 50 different skills that can be used to advance the game, such as <strong>combat</strong> and <strong>slots</strong>.<br>\u3000Opening up skills will power up the entire game and propel the game forward.<br><br>The <strong>mushroom</strong>.<br>\u3000The game's <strong>slots</strong> are not just about luck.<br>\u3000By <strong>eating</strong> mushrooms[/b], you can manipulate the role you win to some extent.<br><br>The <strong>battle</strong>.<br>\u3000The <strong>battle</strong> proceeds according to the result of the <strong>slot</strong>.<br>\u3000The result depends on the hero's status and your luck.<br>\u3000You may get <strong>mushrooms</strong> when you defeat enemies.<br><br>Master these four elements and rescue the forest fairies!",
